# Plantasonic Project

Browser-based generative audiovisual instrument — a **living digital ecosystem**, not a synthesizer with visuals. First proof of the repeatable AI-assisted product system.

**Creative constraints:** Read `docs/CREATIVE_VISION.md` before any audio engine, visual engine, preset, or feature work. Run the six-question decision filter. If a change does not make Plantasonic feel more alive, do not implement it.

**Stack:** Vite, TypeScript (strict), Bootstrap 5.0.2, GSAP. Not Next.js or React.

## Repository boundaries

| External repo | Role | Integration |
|---------------|------|-------------|
| ai-product-framework | Process, templates, Cursor rules | `docs/product-framework/` |
| plantasonic-design-system | Tokens, Bootstrap, UI rules | npm package, `src/styles/` |
| plantasia-sound-engine | Audio engine | `src/audio/soundAdapter.ts` — **integrated** (`1.0.0-beta.1`) |
| ascii-visual-engine | Visual engine | `src/visuals/plantasiaAsciiAdapter.ts` — **integrated** |

**Do not:** merge repos, copy engine code, import unstable engine packages, hardcode theme values, add DAW-style parameter panels, add decorative visualizers disconnected from ecosystem metaphor.

