## Architecture

UI → Runtime → Adapters → External engines. Runtime is the only layer that calls both adapters.

Performance controls use ecological names (Bloom, Mold, Density, Chaos, Brightness) — not synthesis jargon.

## Current phase

MVP stabilization and performance complete. Next platform work: recording/sharing (Phase 11) only when aligned with creative vision.
